#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:738
msgid ""
"The first section of this chapter starts with an overview of graph creation,"
" discusses terminology, and presents graph components and their "
"organization. The next section explains the <interface>\"Chart "
"Guru\"</interface> which is the tool used to configure graphs. The "
"subsequent section presents the different types of plots which can be "
"included in a graph and the final section explains how data can be pre-"
"selected to speed up the process of graph creation."
msgstr ""
"Det första avsnittet i kapitlet ger en översikt över hur du skapar grafer, "
"förklarar terminologin och beskriver grafens delar och hur de är "
"organiserade. Nästa avsnitt beskriver "
"<interface>”Diagramguiden”</interface>, verktyget för att konfigurera "
"grafer. Därefter presenteras de olika rittyper som kan ingå i en graf. Det "
"sista avsnittet förklarar hur du kan markera data i förväg för att snabba "
"upp arbetet med att skapa grafer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:750
msgid ""
"Charts are exceedingly effective communication devices. Unfortunately, this "
"means that one cannot determine, simply based on the data to be plotted, "
"what type of plot will be the most effective. Instead users must familiarize"
" themselves with the various types of plots which are available and decide "
"for themselves which plot type is the most effective to communicate an idea."
" <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-overview\"/> contains a detailed explanation of"
" the plot types available in <application>Gnumeric</application>."
msgstr ""
"Diagram är ett mycket effektivt sätt att förmedla information. Därför går "
"det inte att avgöra enbart utifrån data vilken rittyp som fungerar bäst. Du "
"behöver bekanta dig med de tillgängliga typerna och själv avgöra vilken som "
"tydligast förmedlar budskapet. <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-overview\"/> "
"beskriver rittyperna i <application>Gnumeric</application> närmare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:764
msgid "This chapter explains how to add graphs to plot worksheet data."
msgstr ""
"Det här kapitlet beskriver hur du skapar grafer av data i ett kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2
msgid "Overview of Graphs"
msgstr "Översikt över grafer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"This overview will start with a brief summary of the process involved in "
"creating a graph, then will discuss the terminology used in this document, "
"will present the components of a graph, and present the hierarchy of the "
"components used in to configure the graphs."
msgstr ""
"Översikten börjar med en kort sammanfattning av hur du skapar en graf. "
"Därefter förklaras terminologin i dokumentet, grafens delar och hierarkin "
"som används när du konfigurerar den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:13 C/gnumeric.xml:666
msgid "The Graph Creation Process"
msgstr "Skapa en graf"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:15
msgid ""
"The process of graph creation involves several steps each of which requires "
"the user to understand clearly what they intend to do. This outline is "
"presented to help users understand the subsequent discussion in this "
"document."
msgstr ""
"När du skapar en graf går du igenom flera steg. För varje steg behöver du "
"veta vad du vill åstadkomma. Följande översikt hjälper dig att förstå resten"
" av dokumentet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:24
msgid "Outline of the procedure to create a graph."
msgstr "Översikt över hur du skapar en graf."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:95
msgid "Inserting the graph"
msgstr "Infoga grafen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:98
msgid ""
"Finally, the graph is inserted into the worksheet like any other graphical "
"element, as was explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-"
"adding\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Till sist infogar du grafen i kalkylbladet på samma sätt som andra grafiska "
"element, enligt beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-"
"adding\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:114
msgid "On Terminology"
msgstr "Terminologi"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:118
msgid ""
"The terminology used for describing the components of data graphs is "
"confusing because graphs use many components and the words are applied "
"arbitrarily to each component. For example, the words \"graph\", \"chart\", "
"and \"plot\" could be used interchangeably but in "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> these words are used as explained below."
msgstr ""
"Terminologin för delarna i datagrafer kan vara förvirrande eftersom grafer "
"består av många delar och benämningarna används godtyckligt. Orden ”graf”, "
"”diagram” och ”rittyp” kan till exempel användas om vartannat, men i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har de betydelserna som förklaras nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:127
msgid ""
"The term 'graph' will be used, in this documentation, to refer to the entire"
" graphical element placed on the worksheet. A graph has an outline and a "
"background, may have one or more titles, and will have at least one 'chart'."
msgstr ""
"I den här dokumentationen syftar ”graf” på hela det grafiska objektet i "
"kalkylbladet. En graf har en kantlinje och en bakgrund, kan ha en eller "
"flera rubriker och innehåller minst ett ”diagram”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:134
msgid ""
"The term 'chart' will be used to denote an intermediate level element which "
"has an outline and a background, may have one or more titles, may have a "
"legend and will have at least one 'plot'. To support the plot, the chart may"
" have a 'grid' area behind the plotted data, and have one or more axes."
msgstr ""
"”Diagram” betecknar en mellanliggande del med kantlinje och bakgrund. Den "
"kan ha en eller flera rubriker, en förklaring och minst en ”rittyp”. "
"Diagrammet kan också ha ett rutnätsområde bakom den utritade datan och en "
"eller flera axlar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:142
msgid ""
"Each 'plot' will be defined to be of a particular type when it is created. "
"Plots will have one or more 'series' of data values which will define the "
"magnitude of the values of to be plotted and may define a number of other "
"related values including errors in the x and y directions."
msgstr ""
"Varje ”rittyp” tilldelas en särskild typ när den skapas. Den innehåller en "
"eller flera dataserier vars värden anger storleken på det som ska ritas ut. "
"Serierna kan också innehålla andra relaterade värden, till exempel felvärden"
" i x- och y-led."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:152
msgid ""
"This terminology can be used to describe in detail the components of a graph"
" in <application>Gnumeric</application>. <xref linkend=\"fig-graph-"
"components\"/> presents the components of a graph."
msgstr ""
"Med den här terminologin går det att beskriva delarna i en graf i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> i detalj. <xref linkend=\"fig-graph-"
"components\"/> visar grafens delar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:164
msgid "The Components of Graphs"
msgstr "Grafens delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:167
msgid "The components of <application>Gnumeric</application> graphs"
msgstr "Delarna i grafer i <application>Gnumeric</application>"
